Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.23,0:03:47.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《住院的病人》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.19,0:04:06.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放松点 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mustn't take it so badly Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.03,0:04:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:12.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道这么说有点难为情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I know it's inconvenient but you really mustn't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.95,0:04:14.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你不能让它影响你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let it affect you like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.87,0:04:17.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在说什么啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:21.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一直怒愤难抑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are sitting there boiling with indignation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为你被迫离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you have been forced to leave{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.54,0:04:25.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}221B这么一间舒适的公寓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the warmth and comfort of 221B by the order{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.67,0:04:28.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太正在进行春季大扫除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Mrs. Hudson's spring cleaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.51,0:04:34.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的华生 你是怎么推断出的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear Watson however did you deduce that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:38.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是简单地运用了下你的方法罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By simply applying your methods Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:39.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:41.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相信你来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll agree that you are not here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:43.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是为了剪发或刮胡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for either a shave or a haircut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:45.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:46.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么知道的呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:49.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为很明显你自己已经刮了胡子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you invariably shave yourself and you are patently{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:51.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而距你下一次剪发还有两周的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not due for a haircut for another two weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:53.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.83,0:04:57.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你刚才很匆忙地离开了房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you left our rooms in some haste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.79,0:05:00.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没有戴手套 也没有拿手杖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are without either your gloves or your cane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.84,0:05:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 我知道哈德森太太一直在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,I know that Mrs. Hudson's been trying to complete{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:11.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}忙活着春季大扫除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}her spring cleaning all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:15.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现如今 你静坐于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,you have been sitting there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:18.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}双眉紧锁 闭目不语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}frowning,eyes tightly closed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:20.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}咬牙切齿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}grinding your teeth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:21.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一直击打着手指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all the time your fingers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.67,0:05:22.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像活塞运动一样有规律地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have been drumming like pistons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.82,0:05:24.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}击打着椅子扶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the arm of that chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.43,0:05:29.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愚钝如我也不难推断出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So given all this at once even I cannot fail to deduce{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:33.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和我们善良的管家吵架了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you are have quarreled with our good housekeeper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:36.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后就来理发店寻找安宁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sought refuge in the sanity of the barbershop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:42.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无可否认 我的推断是正确的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot deny that I am right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:47.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 华生 这样你就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,Watson you could not be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:48.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大错特错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}further from the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.94,0:05:52.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是来征询理发师的意见的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am here to get our good barber's advice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.86,0:05:55.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个是在案发现场找到的头发样本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as to the specimen of hair found at the scene{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:05:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是上周二在德布福特发生的血腥惨剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a bloody misadventure last Tuesday in Debford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.49,0:05:59.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 快点说吧 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,come along Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:01.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你肯定是在担心什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're worried about something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:04.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你口中所说的焦虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you perceived as agitation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:09.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}实际上是平静的享受才是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was indeed most intense tranquil enjoyment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:13.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我双目紧闭是因为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My eyes were closed because I was trying to recall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:17.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨夜演奏会上的盛况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as vividly as I could the concert{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:19.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此让人回味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we attended last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:22.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在咬牙切齿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were grinding your teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.16,0:06:24.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是因为我在回想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is because I made a slight error{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.98,0:06:28.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}厄尔吉安弹奏贝多芬的小提琴协奏曲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in my recollection of Urkian's fingering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:31.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第三章的华彩部分时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his cadenza in the third movement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.13,0:06:32.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出了一点小小的差错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the Beethoven Violin Concerto{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.91,0:06:46.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过话说回头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nevertheless there is an element of truth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.67,0:06:47.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你所说的还是有点道理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in what you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.50,0:06:48.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.13,0:07:11.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A doctor's,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:13.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位全科医生 我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a general practitioner's I perceive,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}开业不久 或许生意还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not been long in practice or had much to do,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.01,0:07:19.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是来找我们商量事情的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come to consult us I fancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.73,0:07:21.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们回来得太巧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky we came back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:48.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah,Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.61,0:07:49.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 哈德森夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.86,0:07:55.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医生 这是我的朋友兼同事 华生先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor,this is my friend and colleague Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.81,0:07:59.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐 阁下莅临寒舍 未知所为何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pray resume your seat and tell me how I may serve you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.67,0:08:03.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的确是医生 我叫珀西·特里维廉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,I am indeed a doctor and my name is Percy Travelian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:05.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}住在布鲁克街403号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I live at number 403 Brook Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:07.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you the author{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:08.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3} 《原因不明的神经损伤》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a monograph upon obscure nervous lesions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:10.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那篇论文的作者吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a monograph upon obscure nervous lesions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.45,0:08:13.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 但甚少听人提及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,but I so seldom hear of the work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.02,0:08:14.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还以为早被遗忘了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it quite dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:17.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么会呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By no means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:18.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出版商向我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My publishers have given me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:21.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这本书销路不广\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a most discouraging account of its sales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.51,0:08:24.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也是从医的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are yourself a medical man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.59,0:08:26.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}退役的外科军医\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retired army surgeon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.09,0:08:30.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对神经病学很感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My hobby has always been the study of nervous disease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.43,0:08:31.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很希望能够对它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should of course like to make it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.89,0:08:34.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进行专门研究 不过 一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an absolute specialty but a man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.39,0:08:36.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然必须从事他首先能够着手的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must take what he can get first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.90,0:08:40.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然 这是题外话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However,this is beside the question{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.07,0:08:42.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I do appreciate,Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.42,0:08:44.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的时间是多么宝贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how very valuable your time is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:48.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在布鲁克街我的寓所里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact is that a singular train of events{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:50.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最近发生了一连串非常奇怪的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has occurred recently at my house in Brook Street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.08,0:08:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今晚 这些事情已经到了非常严重的关头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tonight they came to such a head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我感到实在不能再耽误了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I felt it was impossible to wait another hour{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.98,0:08:58.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须马上来请你出出主意 帮个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before asking for your advice and your assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:01.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要我出主意 帮忙 我非常欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are very welcome to both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.78,0:09:09.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请把那些使你感到不安的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me have a detailed account of the circumstances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:10.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}详细地讲给我听听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which have disturbed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:12.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其中有一两件事如此琐碎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well one or two of them are so trivial{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:15.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以至于我都不好意思提及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I am almost ashamed to mention them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.27,0:09:16.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过这件事令人非常莫名片妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the matter is so inexplicable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.63,0:09:18.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而近来变得更加复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the recent turn it has taken so elaborate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:21.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只好把一切都摆在你面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I shall lay it all before you and you shall judge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.32,0:09:23.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请你取其精华 去其糟粕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what is essential and what is not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:30.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是伦敦大学毕业的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a London University man and I am not unduly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:34.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以说我是优等生 绝不是自吹自擂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}singing my praises when I say I was a very promising student{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:36.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的前途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it was thought a distinguished career{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.86,0:09:38.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一片光明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lay before me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.11,0:09:41.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而 就在此时 最大的障碍出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However,there was one great stumbling block.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:42.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}钱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.81,0:09:45.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 医生 钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed doctor,money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:48.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要一笔资金开始行医\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I needed capital not only to practice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.85,0:09:50.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及逃离我被迫租下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but also to get out of the scrawled rooms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.73,0:09:52.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一团糟的公寓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was forced to rent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.82,0:09:54.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要连像样点的设备都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could not expect my patients to trust me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:57.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又怎么能叫我的病人相信我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I could not afford the proper equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.41,0:10:00.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊 这已经是司空见惯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,I've seen it happen to too many of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:02.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也被迫从军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I myself was obliged to go into the army{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.52,0:10:04.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以此来开始我的职业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order to follow my career.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:05.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:08.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想过放弃自己的职业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had thought of abandoning my own career{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:12.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是突如其来的一件事改变了我的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except for one sudden and unexpected incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.21,0:10:14.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到底是怎样的事呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly what kind of incident?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两年前的一个早上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One morning two years ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.32,0:10:20.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个男人上门造访 他的名字叫布莱星顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I received a visit from a man by the name of Blessington{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.35,0:10:23.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在此之前我们素未谋面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who until that time had been a complete stranger to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.65,0:10:45.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.20,0:10:56.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老天爷啊 你就住这 就这里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good heavens,do you live here,in this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.79,0:10:59.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 恐怕如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,I'm afraid I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:01.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就是那位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the same Percy Travelian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:03.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}取得卓越成就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who's had so distinguished a career,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.94,0:11:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最近获奖的珀西·特里维廉先生吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}recently won the Slater award for medicine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:09.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:14.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坦率地回答我的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then answer me frankly sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.68,0:11:16.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会看到这样做对你是有好处的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you'll find it in your interest to do so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.60,0:11:19.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要不是你现在的财务困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Despite your present financial situation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.79,0:11:21.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的才学一定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you clearly have all the cleverness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:23.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会让你青云直上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that makes a successful man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.23,0:11:25.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你够圆滑机智吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But have you the tact?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:28.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信我会尽力而为的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust that I have my share,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:30.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有无不良嗜好？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any bad habits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.74,0:11:32.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不酗酒吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not drawn toward drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.51,0:11:33.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now really sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:37.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite right,quite right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.73,0:11:44.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我必须问一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I was bound to ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:46.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.49,0:11:47.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:50.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你既然有这些本事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simply why with all these qualities{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么不开业行医呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are you not in practice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:55.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在知道了英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come now it's that old story more in the brains{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.35,0:11:56.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么也要为五斗米折腰了吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than in the pocket hey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:11:59.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我帮你在布鲁克街开业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now sir what would say sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:01.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的意见如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I were to start you in Brook Street?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.76,0:12:05.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}专业人士要想成功必须志向高远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If a specialist is to succeed he must aim high{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:08.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在布鲁克街行医只是个开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a practice in Brook Street is just the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.85,0:12:11.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}留意了 要穿着光鲜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Capital,keep yourself in style,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:14.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}租个像样的马车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the hire of respectable carriage and horse,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:18.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最好的手术室 候诊室和仆役\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}surgery that's worthy of you,waiting room,servants{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.92,0:12:22.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有外面能买到的最好的设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the best equipment that money can buy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.72,0:12:26.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些是你将会拥有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is what you will have sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:38.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是为什么啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:41.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这正像别的投机事业一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just like any other investment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:42.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过比较更保险一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}safer than most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.53,0:12:46.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么 我该做些什么事呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what am I to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:47.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我自然会告诉你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:50.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要替你租房子 置家具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will take the house,furnish it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.31,0:12:52.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}雇女仆 管理一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pay the maids and run the whole place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:54.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你所要做的就是安安分分地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you have to do is to wear out the chair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.90,0:12:56.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坐在你的诊室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in your consulting room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.30,0:12:59.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你所赚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you hand over to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:01.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要占四分之三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three quarters of everything you earn{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:04.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}剩下的四分之一你自己留着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and keep one quarter for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:08.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得这个提议怎样呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what do you say to that sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:13.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你同意吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you agree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:18.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 这就是那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This then Mr. Holmes was the strange proposal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:20.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叫布莱星顿的陌生人给我提的奇怪建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with which Mr. Blessington approached me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.83,0:13:26.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不再叙述我们怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not weary you with how we{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.39,0:13:28.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}协商 成交的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bargained and negotiated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.27,0:13:32.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}结果是 我在报喜节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it ended with my moving into the house next quarter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:35.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}搬进了这个寓所 并按他所提出的条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and starting in practice on very much the same conditions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.15,0:13:36.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}开始营业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as he had suggested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:58.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是候诊室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiting room for your patients.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.38,0:14:30.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的诊室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your consulting room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:38.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难以置信啊 布莱星顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it Mr. Blessington,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:42.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叫我怎么感谢你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nor can I thank you enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:46.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他把一楼最好的两间房改成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He turned the two best rooms on the first floor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.17,0:14:48.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}起居室和他自己的卧室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into a sitting room and a bedroom for himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:51.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后以住院病人的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and came to live with me in the character of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:53.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和我住在了一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a resident patient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.56,0:14:57.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的心脏衰弱 但算不上不正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His heart was weak but not abnormal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:15:00.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然 他需要经常治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet he demanded constant medical supervision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:07.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他脾气古怪 闭门谢客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a man of singular habits,shunning company{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:11.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}深居简出 不过有一件事除外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and very seldom going out except in one respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:15.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在每天晚上的同一时刻 他都会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every evening at the same time he would go for a walk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:19.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}外出散步半小时 风雨不改\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for half an hour exactly no matter what the weather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.15,0:15:24.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且每晚同一时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every evening at the same hour{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.24,0:15:26.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他都会踱进我的诊室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he would walk into the consulting room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.22,0:15:27.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}检查账目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would then examine the books,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.89,0:15:30.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赚的诊费 每1几尼他给我留5先令3便士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}put down five crumpets for every guinea I had earned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.02,0:15:33.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其余的他全部拿走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then carried the rest off to the strong box{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放到他自己屋内的保险箱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in his own room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:43.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以非常自信地说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may say with confidence Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.84,0:15:46.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对这项投机生意 他永远也不会后悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he never had occasion to regret his speculation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.97,0:15:49.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一开始 生意就很成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the first it was a success{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:52.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}近两年来 我使他变成了一个富翁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and during the last two years I have made him a rich man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.54,0:15:54.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是这些了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So much Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.69,0:15:57.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我过去的经历以及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for my past history and my relations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.19,0:15:59.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和布莱星顿先生的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the resident patient Mr. Blessington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.22,0:16:01.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要告诉你的 现在只剩下一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It only remains for me now to tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.78,0:16:03.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是我今晚来此求教的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what has occurred to bring me here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几星期之前 布莱星顿先生下楼来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some weeks ago Mr. Blessington came down to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.83,0:16:10.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我似乎觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in as it seemed to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:13.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 他的心情异常激动 - 特里维廉医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- a considerable state of agitation. - Dr. Travelian,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.36,0:16:16.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特里维廉医生 特里维廉医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Travelian,Dr. Travelian,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:18.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特里维廉医生 特里维廉医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Travelian,Dr. Travelian,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.99,0:16:21.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特里维廉医生 特里维廉医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Travelian,Dr. Travelian sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.39,0:16:23.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱星顿先生 冷静下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Blessington calm yourself sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.26,0:16:25.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冷静 你叫我怎么冷静？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm myself? Calm myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.66,0:16:28.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没有听说那件盗窃案吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my dear sir have you not heard of the burglary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.31,0:16:30.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}盗窃案？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burglary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:32.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪里啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.54,0:16:34.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 不 不是这里 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,no not here sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.63,0:16:37.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是这里 但是可能会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not here,but it could have been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.47,0:16:43.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could have been...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.56,0:16:49.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一周之内整栋房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Within a week the whole house had become{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:52.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的门窗都被加固闩牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a fortress of bolts and bars and locks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.15,0:16:54.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你确定这些栅栏足够坚固吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure these bars are strong enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.34,0:16:57.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它们坚固得用在英格兰银行都绰绰有余了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'd be strong enough for the bank of England,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.05,0:16:58.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱星顿先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Blessington?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:01.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我向他问到这件事时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I questioned him upon the point{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:03.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他变得非常无礼 于是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he became so offensive that I was compelled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.10,0:17:04.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就不再谈这件事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to drop the subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:08.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}刚开始我还以为他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At first Mr. Holmes I thought he merely sought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.00,0:17:09.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是想保护他的保险箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to protect his strong box,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:13.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但后来我发觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but then I suspected that it was his life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.11,0:17:14.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是在保护自己的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he was protecting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.39,0:17:19.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从那之后他就完全不外出了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From then on he stopped going out all together,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不停地从窗户往外看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}peered continually out of his windows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.98,0:17:24.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把自己锁在房间里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and kept himself locked in his room in what{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:30.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只能说他已经到了极度焦虑的状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could only describe as a state of mortal dread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:04.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特里维廉医生 在你继续之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Travelian,before you continue,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.09,0:18:08.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说你发现布莱星顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you say you found this man Blessington{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.49,0:18:10.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}终日卧床 手抓报纸 并且日渐虚弱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}prostrate on his bed clutching a newspaper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:14.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准确点说是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More precisely the remains of a newspaper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他撕下的报纸条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for he had torn it to shreds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:20.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}撕成报纸条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Torn to shreds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.44,0:18:27.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还记得报纸上的内容吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you recall the contents of this newspaper at all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.30,0:18:30.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不记得了 但我发现了些新的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,I'm afraid not even if I'd known what I was looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.49,0:18:31.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么时候呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When was this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.85,0:18:32.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几周之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was some weeks ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:34.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像是五月初\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the beginning of May I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.98,0:18:36.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}时间一天天过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gradually as time passed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.54,0:18:38.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的恐惧似乎逐渐消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his fears appeared to die away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.94,0:18:40.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他又恢复了常态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he renewed his former habits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:42.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安 特里维廉医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening Dr. Travelian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:44.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}外面天气多好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful evening outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.09,0:18:47.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我又开始出去散步了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm beginning to enjoy my walks again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.47,0:18:53.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后突如其来地一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then suddenly a fresh event reduced him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.44,0:18:55.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他就此卧床不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the pitiable state of prostration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.31,0:18:56.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}知道现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in which he now lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.82,0:19:01.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事情是这样的 昨天我收到一封信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened was yesterday I received this letter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:04.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位侨居在英国的俄罗斯贵族寄来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from a Russian nobleman now resident in England{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.49,0:19:06.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他深受强直性昏厥病的折磨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who suffers from catalepsy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在信中写道亟愿到我处就医\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In it he announces his intention of visiting me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.45,0:19:10.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备明晚六点一刻左右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a consultation this very evening{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:11.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}前往就诊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at a quarter past six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:19.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于对强直症进行研究的主要困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of the chief difficulty in the study of catalepsy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:21.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在于这种疾病是罕见的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the rareness of the disease{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:25.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以相信 在约定时间那时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you may believe that at the appointed hour{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.03,0:19:27.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经心焦地等候在我的诊室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was eager to receive the patient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.95,0:19:29.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚上好啊 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.14,0:19:32.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是特里维廉医生 我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Dr. Travelian and it was you sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.65,0:19:34.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是阁下给我写的信吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume who wrote to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.84,0:19:39.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医生 我的父亲很少说英语的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father speaks very little English doctor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.43,0:19:43.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以希望你不介意我陪他进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I trust you will excuse my coming in with him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:44.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的健康问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as his health is a matter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.64,0:19:47.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我是极重要的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the most overwhelming importance to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.87,0:19:49.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 这个我清楚 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,I respect that sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.33,0:19:50.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}芬顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fenton,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.36,0:19:55.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许在诊治时 你愿意留在诊室里吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}perhaps you would like to join us for the consultation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:57.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不行 绝对不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nyet,nyet,not for all of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:20:01.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我受不了这种痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is more painful to me than I can express.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:03.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我看到我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I were to see my father in one of those{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.93,0:20:06.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}疾病发作时那种可怕的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dreadful seizures I am convinced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:20:08.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信我是忍受不了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would never survive it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:09.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我自己的神经官能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My own nervous system{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:12.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也十分敏感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is an exceptionally sensitive one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:15.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你如允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With your permission I will remain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:16.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在你给我父亲诊治时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in your waiting room while you go into my father's case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.97,0:20:18.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以在候诊室里等候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in your waiting room while you go into my father's case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.64,0:20:20.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 当然可以啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.35,0:20:22.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thank you doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 芬顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you Fenton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.06,0:20:44.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在先生 请允许我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now sir,I hope you will forgive me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:47.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问你几个基本的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I ask you a few basic questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.36,0:20:52.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首先 你能告诉我你的年龄吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First,can you tell me your age?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:55.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}67\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixty-seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.12,0:20:59.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了强直性昏厥病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And apart from catalepsy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.41,0:21:01.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是否觉得自己身体健壮呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you say you are physically sound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.85,0:21:05.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也就是说你的身体还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Normally do you have good health?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.50,0:21:08.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 没有头痛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um,no headaches?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.95,0:21:11.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}腹痛呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abdominal pain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.87,0:21:14.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有没有感觉到疼痛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any pain at all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:17.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.66,0:21:18.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.90,0:21:23.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首先我要给你做个全身检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Naturally I will examine you thoroughly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.82,0:21:25.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这只是初步检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this is merely a preliminary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.74,0:21:28.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你抽雪茄吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you smoke cigars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.45,0:21:30.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.64,0:21:33.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你喝酒吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you drink alcohol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:35.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伏特加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vodka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:37.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伏特加？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vodka?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:39.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.90,0:21:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每天？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:56.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没想到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't expect...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.46,0:22:04.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我最初的感觉是既怜悯又害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my first feeling was one of pity and horror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.70,0:22:06.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}后来 我的职业兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My second I fear was rather{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.89,0:22:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}占了上风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of professional satisfaction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.33,0:22:12.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪一方面都没有发现与我以前所诊断的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was nothing markedly abnormal in his condition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.93,0:22:15.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种病例有不一致的现象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which had harmonized with my former experiences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.31,0:22:19.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在之前类似的病例中 我使用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had obtained good results in such cases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.71,0:22:22.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}烷基亚硝酸吸入剂 取得了良好的疗效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the inhalation of nitrite of alma{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.95,0:22:25.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在似乎正是试验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the present seemed an admirable opportunity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.97,0:22:27.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它疗效的极好机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of testing its virtues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.31,0:22:32.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生 我相信你能听见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now sir,I believe you can hear me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.64,0:22:34.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很快就会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should be back directly rest assured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.90,0:23:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}芬顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fenton,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.57,0:23:40.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}芬顿 芬顿 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fenton,Fenton immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.25,0:23:50.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}芬顿 你15分钟之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fenton,the two gentlemen you showed in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.44,0:23:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带上来那两位先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}less than 15 minutes ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.38,0:23:52.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你见到他们走了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did you see them leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.84,0:23:54.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走？没有啊 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave,no sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.24,0:23:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.70,0:23:58.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确定 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm positive sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.11,0:24:11.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚上好啊 特里维廉医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening Dr. Travelian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.19,0:24:12.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚上好 布莱星顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening Mr. Blessington{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:14.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你今天的散步如何呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and how was your walk today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.95,0:24:17.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有点小雨 但还是很愉快的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little rain but very amiable my good sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.76,0:24:19.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very amiable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.67,0:24:23.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你听到他们离开吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear them leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.71,0:24:24.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.27,0:24:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不在大厅附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was nowhere near the hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.73,0:24:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不应该离开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well you should have been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.88,0:24:29.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是你的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is your duty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.03,0:24:31.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你是刚来的 但现在你应该记住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I know you are new here but you should know by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.11,0:24:34.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医生 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor! doctor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.49,0:24:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医生 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doctor! doctor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.47,0:24:39.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人进过我的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone has been in my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.66,0:24:41.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有人进过你的房间 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one has been in your room sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.23,0:24:42.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.38,0:24:44.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lying to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.04,0:24:46.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向你保证我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assure you I am not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.07,0:24:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}芬顿 你进过布莱星顿先生的房间吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fenton,have you been in Mr. Blessington's room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.82,0:24:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我肯定没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I haven't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.70,0:24:54.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就说 你听到了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.06,0:24:56.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你自己上来看下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then come up and see for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.74,0:25:06.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么事 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.67,0:25:08.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看下那里吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.37,0:25:14.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你敢说这是我的脚印？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you telling me that they're mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.48,0:25:18.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 一眼看上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well at first glance they do appear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.15,0:25:19.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这的确大了点 不是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be too large for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.61,0:25:22.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些肯定不是我的脚印\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course they're not mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.21,0:25:25.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从来都是在前门脱套鞋的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always remove my galoshes at the front door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.86,0:25:27.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么被盗的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has anything been stolen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.64,0:25:29.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 但这个不是重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,but that's not the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.24,0:25:31.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有东西被盗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing has been stolen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.39,0:25:34.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的隐私被陌生人侵犯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My privacy has been invaded by a stranger,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.00,0:25:35.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这还不够吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that not enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.02,0:25:55.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱星顿先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Blessington?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.98,0:25:59.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱星顿先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Blessington?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.86,0:26:03.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你给我出去 我要单独呆会 出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave me alone,go away and leave me alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.55,0:26:06.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信我能帮上什么忙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely there's something I can do to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.37,0:26:08.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要我叫警察吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I call the police?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.62,0:26:11.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要 不要叫那些喇叭手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No... Not those buglers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.86,0:26:19.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在只有一个人能帮我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one person who can help me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.03,0:26:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是我上这儿来的原因了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that is why I am here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.43,0:26:26.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么琐碎的事情麻烦你 我实在很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I must apologize for such a trivial reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.43,0:26:30.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个什么都不偷的贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A thief that doesn't steal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.83,0:26:32.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他有指名道姓说要我帮忙吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he ask for me by name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.65,0:26:34.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.61,0:26:39.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then let us be on our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.27,0:26:47.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.67,0:26:49.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这边？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.22,0:26:58.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}站在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.47,0:27:00.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有手枪的 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a pistol and I give you my word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.66,0:27:02.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你再走近一点 我就射你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will shoot if you come any nearer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.74,0:27:05.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱星顿先生 不要那么无礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Blessington this is outrageous sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.19,0:27:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不认得我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you not recognize me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.19,0:27:13.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你吗 医生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that you doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.07,0:27:15.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 就是我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,of course it is me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.36,0:27:16.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另外两位先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other two gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.03,0:27:18.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是假扮的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are they what they pretend to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.01,0:27:20.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are Mr. Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.79,0:27:22.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和他的朋友华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his friend Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.98,0:27:24.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝啊 布莱星顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good God Mr. Blessington,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.23,0:27:26.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你让我叫他们来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was you that asked me to fetch them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.56,0:27:32.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 是的 是的 请原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,yes,yes,forgive me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.72,0:27:34.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.42,0:27:46.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们 上来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen do come up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.51,0:27:53.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的警惕冒犯到你们的话 我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry if my precautions have annoyed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.68,0:27:55.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚上好 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.93,0:27:57.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信我是到了迫不得已的地步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure I'm very much obliged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.60,0:27:58.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才请你们来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to you for coming around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.48,0:28:02.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没人比我更需要你的建议了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one has ever needed your advice more than I,no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.33,0:28:05.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信特里维廉医生已经告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I expect Dr. Travelian has told you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.21,0:28:07.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人不经允许闯进我的房间这件事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of this unwarrantable intrusion into my rooms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.92,0:28:09.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱星顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sir,Mr. Blessington,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.07,0:28:10.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那两个男人是谁呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who are these two men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.20,0:28:13.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪两个男人啊 我不认识他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which two men,I don't know them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.28,0:28:16.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那他们为什么要打扰你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why do they wish to molest you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.79,0:28:18.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}打扰我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Molest me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.87,0:28:21.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可不能指望我来回答这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could hardly expect me to answer that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.58,0:28:23.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是说你不知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean that you don't know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.03,0:28:26.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in here,please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.74,0:28:31.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just have the kindness to step in here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.40,0:28:48.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从来就不是个富人 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been a rich man,Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.91,0:28:51.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一生只做过一次投资\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never made but one investment in my life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.31,0:28:52.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特里维廉医生会告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Travelian will tell you that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.70,0:28:56.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有多么不相信银行家的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't believe in bankers sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.62,0:28:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝对不要相信银行家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never trust a banker{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.08,0:28:59.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 绝不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes,never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.59,0:29:02.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我们之间的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's between ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.36,0:29:05.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我全部身家都在这保险箱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What little I have is here in this strong box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.01,0:29:07.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can understand what it means to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.68,0:29:08.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陌生人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when unknown people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.62,0:29:10.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}潜进我的房间这件事对我有多重要了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}force themselves into my rooms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.77,0:29:20.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱星顿先生 要是你一定要蒙骗我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Blessington I cannot possibly advise you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.51,0:29:22.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是没法帮助你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you try to deceive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.49,0:29:23.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蒙骗你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deceive you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.95,0:29:25.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经告诉你一切了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've told you everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.39,0:29:29.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安 特里维廉医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night Dr. Travelian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.27,0:29:33.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 你不给我一些指教吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes,no advice for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.33,0:29:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对你的指教就是请讲真话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My advice to you is to speak the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.39,0:29:45.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.67,0:29:59.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cab!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.62,0:30:05.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.56,0:30:07.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能从那人的眼睛中看出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can read in a man's eyes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.12,0:30:09.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他只是害怕自己的幻想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when it's his own skin that he's frightened of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.42,0:30:10.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 但你为什么说他说谎呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,But why did you call him a liar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.88,0:30:14.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我知道他认识那两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I am certain that he does know who these men are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.53,0:30:15.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cab!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.57,0:30:21.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位俄罗斯年轻人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A young Russian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.72,0:30:23.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}潜进布莱星顿先生的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}penetrated to Blessington's rooms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.70,0:30:26.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的同谋就引开医生的注意力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while his confederate kept the doctor from interfering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.10,0:30:29.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}强直性昏厥病是很好模仿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And of course catalepsy is a very easy complaint to imitate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.13,0:30:30.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我知道 我自己也做过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,I know I've done it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.42,0:30:32.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.19,0:30:35.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会不会有这么一个可能性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might there be one alternative,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.07,0:30:38.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十分荒诞但同时也是可信的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}grotesquely improbably no doubt but still just conceivable,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.72,0:30:42.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整个故事就是患了强直性昏厥的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}might the whole story of the cataleptic Russian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.06,0:30:44.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和那个儿子都是特里维廉医生编出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and son be a concoction of Dr. Travelian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.56,0:30:47.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他自己居心不良闯进布莱星顿先生的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who for his own purposes has been in Blessington's room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.27,0:30:49.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你看到楼梯上地毯上的脚印了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But did you see the footprints on the stair carpet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.88,0:30:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那鞋印是方头的 而布莱星顿先生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were square toed,quite unlike Blessington's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.42,0:30:56.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鞋子是圆头的 同时又比特里维廉医生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which are round and an inch and a third longer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.03,0:30:57.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}长了1.3寸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than Dr. Travelians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.39,0:30:59.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得我们今晚要好好想下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we can sleep on this Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.04,0:31:02.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不出所料的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I should be surprised if we do not hear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.50,0:31:04.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们明早就会来找我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from Brook Street in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.00,0:31:06.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.88,0:31:08.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安 老朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Night old fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.23,0:31:21.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早啊 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.00,0:31:23.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的茶放门外了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your tea is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.56,0:31:25.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 诺拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you Nora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.93,0:31:55.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱星顿先生 你的茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Blessington,your breakfast tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.02,0:32:00.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱星顿先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Blessington?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.21,0:32:36.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.54,0:32:39.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赶快穿衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get dressed quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.80,0:32:41.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马车在等我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a cab waiting for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.78,0:32:42.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.61,0:32:43.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么事啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.65,0:32:45.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布鲁克街那件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Brook Street business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.74,0:32:47.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么新消息吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any fresh news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.48,0:32:52.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在上帝的面上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For God's sake,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.73,0:32:55.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}立即前来 珀西·特里维廉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come at once,P. Travelian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.36,0:33:00.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 福尔摩斯先生 很高兴你能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,Mr. Holmes I'm so glad you could come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.76,0:33:02.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发生什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What has happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.11,0:33:04.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱星顿先生自杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Blessington has committed suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.09,0:33:05.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自杀？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suicide?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.14,0:33:06.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.28,0:33:08.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在夜里上吊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hung himself during the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.13,0:33:18.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人碰过尸体吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has the body been touched?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.69,0:33:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.82,0:33:23.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听差呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the page?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.39,0:33:24.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nowhere to be found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.43,0:33:47.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好啊 巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.10,0:33:49.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes,delighted to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.23,0:33:52.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在请你看下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now please take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.48,0:33:54.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们正准备把他放下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were just about to take him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.17,0:34:15.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right,inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.95,0:34:17.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}担架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stretcher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.04,0:34:46.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就这样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll be all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.65,0:34:50.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你听说过案子发生前的一些情况了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have heard of the events leading up to this affair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.36,0:34:53.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 特里维廉医生已经跟我说过一些了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,Dr. Travelian has told me something of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.07,0:34:54.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有什么意见吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And have you formed an opinion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.43,0:34:56.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}目前就我所知 他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now as far as I can see,the man was driven{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.20,0:34:58.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该是被吓疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out of his senses by fright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.81,0:35:00.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这张床上他睡了好一阵子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bed has been well slept in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.90,0:35:03.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有很深的压痕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was his impression deep enough for all to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.92,0:35:05.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也知道 自杀常常发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is about 5:00 in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.59,0:35:07.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在早晨五点钟左右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that suicides are most common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.67,0:35:10.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这大约也就是他上吊的时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be about the time that he hanged himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.01,0:35:13.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看来 他是经过再三考虑才这样做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems to be a very deliberate affair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.24,0:35:15.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}根据肌肉僵硬的情况判断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,from the rigidity of the limbs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.70,0:35:17.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看他已经死了大约三个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say he'd been dead about three hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.79,0:35:18.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢华生.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.56,0:35:21.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你注意到屋子里有什么异常现象吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Notice anything peculiar about the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.65,0:35:22.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在洗手池上发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a screwdriver on the mantel piece{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.80,0:35:23.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一把螺丝起子和一些螺丝钉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a screwdriver on the mantel piece{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.09,0:35:27.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还发现他夜里似乎抽过不少烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he seems to have smoked heavily during the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.38,0:35:29.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我在壁炉里找到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found these in the fireplace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.56,0:35:38.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你找到他的雪茄烟嘴了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you his cigar holder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.54,0:35:40.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 我没有看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,I haven't seen one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.40,0:35:44.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么 他的烟盒呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His cigar case then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.17,0:35:46.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有 在他的外衣口袋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,it was in his coat pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.54,0:35:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是一支哈瓦那烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is savannah,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.40,0:36:02.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而壁炉台上的这些是特殊品种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And these others are the cigars of a peculiar sort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.42,0:36:03.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是荷兰从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is imported by the Dutch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.68,0:36:05.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它的东印度殖民地进口的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the East Indian colonies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.87,0:36:09.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些雪茄通常都包着稻草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're usually wrapped in straw you know and are thinner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.41,0:36:11.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且比别的牌子的都细\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for their length than any other brand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.81,0:36:13.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信你没有读过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't suppose you've read monograph{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.37,0:36:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}雪茄和抽雪茄这个行为的论文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on cigars and cigar action?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.15,0:36:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我 嗯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I,um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.71,0:36:18.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 当然没有 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,of course not. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.03,0:36:25.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些是用烟嘴抽的 而这些不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These have been smoked with a holder and these without.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.08,0:36:31.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些是用一把较钝的小刀削过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These have been cut by a not very sharp knife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.52,0:36:33.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另两个烟头是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and these have had their ends bitten off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.40,0:36:37.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用尖锐的牙齿咬下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by a set of very excellent teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.47,0:36:46.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨晚这里有三个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were three men here last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.06,0:36:51.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老天啊 可是什么都没有被盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good heavens but nothing was stolen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.44,0:36:53.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们究竟在干吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so what were they doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.73,0:36:56.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我们要找出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is what we have to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.86,0:36:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们怎么进来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did they get in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.90,0:37:00.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像我们一样从前门进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same way we did through the front door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.41,0:37:02.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早晨门是上锁的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the door was barred in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.28,0:37:04.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么门是在他们走后锁上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it was barred after they left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.41,0:37:06.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么知道呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well how do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.39,0:37:08.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看到了他们留下的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw their traces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.27,0:37:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请稍等一等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you would just give me a few moments Inspector,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.04,0:37:13.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就能给你们进一步说明它的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may be able to give you some further information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.45,0:37:24.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要动 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.91,0:40:05.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实很简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The actual facts are very simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.04,0:40:07.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如无意外下午\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I shall be surprised if by the afternoon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.39,0:40:10.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就能给你和他们一个交代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot give you the reasons for them as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.83,0:40:13.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 福尔摩斯 你现在不能说吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Holmes,can't you tell us anything now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.05,0:40:20.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 事情的次序可是不能颠倒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,there is no doubt as to the sequence of events.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.53,0:40:21.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有三个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The three of them in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.62,0:40:24.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个年轻人 一个老人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A young man,an old man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.39,0:40:28.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有另外一个人身份不明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a third to whose identity I have no clue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.06,0:40:33.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}头两个不用想就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first two I need hardly remark are the same{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.98,0:40:37.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是假扮成俄罗斯父子的那两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who masqueraded as the Russian Count and his son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.32,0:40:39.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此我们很清楚他们的特征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we can give a very good description of them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.20,0:40:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吧 特里维廉医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can we not Dr. Travelian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.87,0:40:43.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是被这所房子里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were admitted by a confederate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.37,0:40:45.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个同伙放进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}inside the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.04,0:40:52.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们进到大厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They entered the hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.28,0:40:57.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首先是老人 然后是年轻人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The older man first,the younger man second{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.66,0:40:59.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}神秘人在后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the unknown man in the rear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.29,0:41:05.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们上楼梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They ascended the stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.20,0:41:16.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们用一根铁丝去转动里面的钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the help of a wire they forced the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.78,0:41:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们甚至不用放大镜 也可以从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even without the lens you can see where{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.45,0:41:21.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这把钥匙榫槽上的划痕看出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the pressure has been applied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.42,0:41:27.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们进入室内 第一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On entering the room the first proceeding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.17,0:41:31.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一定是把布莱星顿先生的嘴给塞住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must have been to gag Mr. Blessington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.75,0:41:41.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很明显 他们把他安置妥当以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having secured Blessington it is evident to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.98,0:41:45.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就商量了一番\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that a consultation of some sort was held{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.05,0:41:49.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种商量可能具有起诉的性质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}probably in the nature of a judicial proceeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.80,0:41:51.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它一定进行了相当一段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must have lasted for some time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.47,0:41:52.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为正是在这段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for it was then{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.30,0:41:53.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们吸了这几支雪茄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the cigars were smoked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.45,0:41:56.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老人坐在那张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was there that the older man sat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.58,0:41:58.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}柳条椅子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the wicker chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.66,0:42:00.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他用的雪茄烟嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was he who used the cigar holder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.38,0:42:03.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}年轻人坐那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The younger man sat there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.88,0:42:06.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他把烟灰磕在了衣柜的对面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knocked his ash off against the chest of drawers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.90,0:42:10.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第三个人在室内踱来踱去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The unknown fellow paced up and down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.97,0:42:13.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想 这时布莱星顿正笔直地坐在床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blessington I think sat upright in the bed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.68,0:42:15.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过对这一点我还不能绝对肯定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but of that I cannot be absolutely certain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.91,0:42:21.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后 他们就去抓布莱星顿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ended of course by them taking Blessington...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.23,0:43:32.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是他们早就安排好了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now this matter was so prearranged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.52,0:43:34.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我相信他们随身带来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it is my belief that they brought with them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.61,0:43:38.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某种滑轮用作绞刑架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some sort of block or pulley to serve as a gallows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.30,0:43:41.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是的 绞刑架 巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,yes as gallows Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.32,0:43:44.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是种报仇的仪式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was a revenge ritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.14,0:43:49.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这故事多精彩啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well an extraordinary story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.46,0:43:51.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但有什么证据呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what proof?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.21,0:43:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天黑之前我会给你证据的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have it before the day is out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.24,0:43:58.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还没解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't explained about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.18,0:43:59.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}螺丝起子和螺丝的用处呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the screws and the screwdriver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.43,0:44:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是用来固定滑轮组或者滑轮的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,that was to fix up the block or pulley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.62,0:44:03.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他们看到吊灯钩的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when they saw the chandelier hook{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.18,0:44:05.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很自然地他们就就地取材\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they naturally saved themselves the trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.06,0:44:08.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我可以向你进一句忠言的话 警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No Inspector I suggest that you immediately make inquiries{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.60,0:44:11.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就应当逮捕那个小听差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about the page and arrest him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.32,0:44:12.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是肯定的 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.57,0:44:15.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在三点钟之前回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will be back here a little before 3:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.05,0:44:17.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.83,0:44:43.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想哈德森夫人看到这个的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I daresay Mrs. Hudson will be a little put out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.85,0:44:45.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定会很不开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when she sees all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.82,0:44:49.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在找什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.59,0:44:51.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃辛顿 W\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worthington,W,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.36,0:44:55.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃辛顿 三月 1880 我确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worthingon,March 1880 I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.64,0:44:57.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}三月 80\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}March '80,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.31,0:45:03.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}80\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'80,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.63,0:45:08.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}January,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.19,0:45:10.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}二月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}February,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.80,0:45:12.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}三月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}March.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.87,0:45:17.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是这个吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.79,0:45:20.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.90,0:45:27.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱星顿 或者说 那时候的萨顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blessington or Sutton as he was known then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.99,0:45:32.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.18,0:45:36.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的小船很快就来了 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your little boat is coming along beautifully Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.62,0:45:38.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 谢谢啊 哈德森夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,thank you Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.81,0:45:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.29,0:46:01.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah,thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.94,0:46:04.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特里维廉医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Travelian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.78,0:46:05.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么消息吗 警官？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any news Inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.82,0:46:07.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 先生 我们在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,sir we've got the page{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.28,0:46:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两条街外找到听差在喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}drinking his earnings two streets away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.85,0:46:11.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我抓到他们了 - 你抓到他们啦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I got the man. - You've got them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.35,0:46:13.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少我知道他们的身份了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or at least I've got their identity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.69,0:46:16.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抢劫沃辛顿银行的那一伙？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Worthington Bank Gang?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.15,0:46:17.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.92,0:46:19.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那布莱星顿肯定就是萨顿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well then Blessington must have been Sutton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.80,0:46:20.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.73,0:46:22.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那现在就水落石出了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that makes it clear as crystal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.82,0:46:24.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还不懂呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not to me I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.28,0:46:25.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生 你 呃…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Watson would you,uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.84,0:46:27.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你应该听说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may have heard of the great{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.30,0:46:29.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃辛顿银行劫案吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worthington bank affair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.29,0:46:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一共有5个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were five men in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.75,0:46:32.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}三个昨晚出现在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The three who were in this room,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.83,0:46:37.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有两个叫卡特莱特和布莱星顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a fourth named Cartwright and Blessington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.26,0:46:45.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright,let's be gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.12,0:47:11.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这可是要被判死刑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a hanging job now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.71,0:47:16.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没人知道就不是啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only if someone squeals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.72,0:47:24.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.29,0:47:26.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you positive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.25,0:47:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 就是他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,yes,that's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.78,0:47:41.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨顿 萨顿 你死定了 死定了 死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sutton,Sutton,you're dead,dead,dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.85,0:47:45.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨顿 你死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sutton,you're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.04,0:47:47.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨顿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sutton...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.19,0:47:50.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不用担心 萨顿先生 他会被判死刑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry Mr. Sutton,it's a hanging job now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.13,0:47:55.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨顿 你听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sutton,you hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.43,0:47:57.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨顿 或者说 布莱星顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sutton or Blessington{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.72,0:48:00.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}成了污点证人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who was the worst of the gang turned informer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.64,0:48:03.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于他的证词 卡特莱特被绞死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On his evidence Cartright was hanged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.08,0:48:07.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另外三个人被判入狱15年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the other three got 15 years apiece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.50,0:48:11.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比德尔 海沃德和莫法特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bibel,Haywood and Moffit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.38,0:48:13.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几周之前出狱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were released from prison just a few weeks ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.88,0:48:16.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们被提前释放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which was several years before their full term.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.70,0:48:19.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们出来的消息让布莱星顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was news of their release which caused Blessington{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.20,0:48:21.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}惊慌不已 他加固了房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to panic and have this house secured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.18,0:48:23.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说他害怕的不是盗窃案？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it was not the fear burglary that had frightened him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.48,0:48:25.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 那只是个烟雾弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,that was a mere blind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.34,0:48:28.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么在我身上投资\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so setting me up in practice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.90,0:48:32.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也是想巧妙地保护他自己？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was an elaborate charade to protect himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.04,0:48:39.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是他为什么不把这件事告诉你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well why could he not tell you this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.43,0:48:41.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在尽量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was trying to hide his own identity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.42,0:48:43.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向所有人隐瞒自己的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from everybody for as long as he could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.81,0:48:45.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的秘密是可耻的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His secret was shameful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.59,0:48:47.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不可能自己泄漏出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he couldn't bring himself to divulge it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.19,0:48:51.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 他虽然卑鄙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However,wretch as he was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.43,0:48:53.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却依然处于英国法律的保护之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he was still living under the shield of British law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.24,0:48:55.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警长 我毫不怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have no doubt Inspector{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.60,0:48:57.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we shall see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.27,0:48:59.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管那个盾没有起到保护作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that though that shield may fail to guard,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.98,0:49:04.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那把正义的剑还是会替他复仇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sword of justice is still there to avenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.61,0:49:07.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管夏洛克·福尔摩斯十分努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In spite of the efforts of Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.59,0:49:09.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那三个杀害布莱星顿的凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the three murderers of Blessington{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.26,0:49:11.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}骗过了警方 离开了这个国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}eluded the police and fled the country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.55,0:49:13.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上了一艘去葡萄牙的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}aboard a ship bound for Portugal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.54,0:49:15.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几周之后我们得悉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a few weeks later that we learned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.83,0:49:17.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那艘"诺拉克列依那"号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the ship,the Nora Crainer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.02,0:49:22.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和全体船员数年以前在葡萄牙海岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had sunk with all hands upon the Portuguese Coast{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.30,0:49:24.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}距波尔图以北数十英里的地方遇难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some leagues to the north of a porter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.50,0:49:57.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.46,0:50:01.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.24,0:50:05.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 我正准备用一天时间写下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well it's just that I was going to spend the day writing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.10,0:50:07.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特里维廉医生的那宗案件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the case of Dr. Travelian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.45,0:50:09.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}趁这一切我都还记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while the facts are still fresh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.85,0:50:13.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 你是说… 哦 我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,you mean... oh,I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.00,0:50:17.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太谢谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks awfully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.61,0:50:23.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可我现在无法集中精神写作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just that it is difficult to concentrate otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.60,0:50:33.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说什么样的题目好呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will you entitle this particular account?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.55,0:50:39.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道你对我的作品竟还有兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know you were interested in my writing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.47,0:50:42.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直都对你的标题的选择很感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am always interested in your choice of titles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.06,0:50:46.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我会用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I thought I would call it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.87,0:50:48.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布鲁克街疑团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Brook Street Mystery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.86,0:50:54.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不行？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.53,0:50:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我自己的话 就会取名叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I myself would prefer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.09,0:51:00.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}住院的病人 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Resident Patient,but please{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.32,0:51:02.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别让我影响到你的思维\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do not let me influence you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.90,0:51:12.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布鲁克街疑团很不错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Brook Street Mystery no doubt would suffice.{\r}
